   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "States - empty (nothing selected): 'Pick a starting key and months'. Key unknown or outside scope: 'No chain for <key> in your scope'. MK without a Planning BOM:\ncomponents step reads 'No Planning BOM for MK <ID> - no component requirement' with link to S-30t. Component start with no MK using it: 'No manufacturing key uses\nthis component in <months>'. Loading: skeleton tree, 'Building chain\u2026'. Error: 'Chain not available: <engine message>', Retry. Success: tree and ribbon.",
   "originalText": "States - empty (nothing selected): 'Pick a starting key and months'. Key unknown or outside scope: 'No chain for <key> in your scope'. MK without a Planning BOM:\ncomponents step reads 'No Planning BOM for MK <ID> - no component requirement' with link to S-30t. Component start with no MK using it: 'No manufacturing key uses\nthis component in <months>'. Loading: skeleton tree, 'Building chain\u2026'. Error: 'Chain not available: <engine message>', Retry. Success: tree and ribbon.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
